OL,3,GNEWSACare home facing closure after
OL,4,Ainspectors raise safety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Aberdeenshire care home faces
OL,7,Fpossible closure after concerns were
OL,8,Fraised about the health and safety of
OL,9,Fits residents.
OL,11,FBonnyton House, in Ellon, was served
OL,12,Fwith an improvement notice by the Care
OL,13,FInspectorate earlier this year, setting
OL,14,Fout requirements for the home to meet.
OL,16,FBut Aberdeenshire Health and Social
OL,17,FCare Partnership (AHSCP) has now
OL,18,Fcancelled its contract with the home,
OL,19,Fsaying it has not been assured that the
OL,20,Fimprovements have been made and
OL,21,Fsustained.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
