OL,3,GNEWSACare home facing closure after
OL,4,Ainspectors raise safety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home's owner Obinna Tochukwu
OL,7,Fdisputes that assessment, and told BBC
OL,8,FScotland News the loss of the contract
OL,9,Fmeant Bonnyton House would probably
OL,10,Fhave to close within the next month -
OL,11,Fwith 24 jobs at risk.
